{"title": "Multiattack: Spores", "pageid": 27891, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Spores", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Spores</b> is a passive feature that allows a Sovereign Spaw to attack more than once when attacking an enemy that is <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The sovereign myconid can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Spaw)\" title=\"Multiattack (Spaw)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Spaw)\" title=\"Multiattack (Spaw)\">Multiattack</a> against a target that's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Befuddled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddled</a> or under the influence of either <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haste Spores\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Haste_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\">Haste Spores</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Spaw</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Spaw)\" title=\"Multiattack (Spaw)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/90/Multiattack_Glut_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Spaw)\" title=\"Multiattack (Spaw)\">Multiattack</a> against a target that's <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddled</a> or under the influence of either <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Bibberbang)_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Bibberbang) (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Haste_Spores_(Condition)\" title=\"Haste Spores (Condition)\">Haste Spores</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715162124\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1649/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12120/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6002/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 767627/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.841      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   49.841      1 -total\n 31.69%   15.796      3 Template:Cond\n 30.45%   15.176      5 Template:Icon_link\n 29.24%   14.571      5 Template:Icon_text\n 24.40%   12.159     10 Template:Trim\n 22.40%   11.162      2 Template:SAI\n 16.67%    8.309      5 Template:Ifempty\n 12.88%    6.421      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.45%    5.707      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Save